From 8964d812c15767bf490962393ec623f1deffbbf3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 10:02:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add the auto agent keyword; host is its last resort only with
 the marker

"auto" picks the first available agent other than the one it protects
and able to run the job (goal reviews need a goal agent, custom reviews
structured output). Host is its last resort only with
ROBOREV_HOST_AGENT=1; a Cursor cloud agent alone never makes host an
automatic pick, and without the marker host is skipped and the next
agent tried. Strict enqueue with an auto backup never takes host.

An auto backup is pinned at enqueue (experiment review, CI, panel, fix,
goal, rerun) and the job records that the pin came from auto, so an
empty pin stays final and an auto-pinned host runs after a restart only
while ROBOREV_HOST_AGENT=1 is still set. --agent auto does not carry the
configured review model over.
